{
  "uid": "rondo-auth",
  "title": "Rondo — Auth",
  "tags": ["rondo", "auth"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Taxa de sucesso do sign-in (período)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "noValue": "sem tentativas"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "expr": "sum(increase(auth_operations_total{operation=\"sign_in\",outcome=\"success\"}[$__range])) / sum(increase(auth_operations_total{operation=\"sign_in\"}[$__range]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Tentativas de auth (período)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "none", "decimals": 0, "noValue": "0" },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "expr": "sum(increase(auth_operations_total[$__range]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Falhas de auth (período)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "none", "decimals": 0, "noValue": "0" },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (increase(auth_operations_total{outcome=\"failure\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Operações por tipo e resultado",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none", "decimals": 0 }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (operation, outcome) (increase(auth_operations_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}} · {{outcome}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Falhas por motivo",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none", "decimals": 0 }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (increase(auth_operations_total{outcome=\"failure\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Duração p95 por operação",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, operation) (rate(auth_operation_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Traces de auth (clique para abrir no Tempo)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 21 },
      "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ resource.service.name = \"rondo-api\" && name =~ \"auth.*\" }",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Logs de auth (event=auth_operation)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 30 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range",
          "expr": "{service_name=\"rondo-api\"} | event=\"auth_operation\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Como usar",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 40 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Cada tentativa nos endpoints de auth é contada **uma vez**, inclusive as recusadas antes do caso de uso (validação, limite de requisições e sessão).\n\n- **Labels:** `operation` (`sign_up`, `confirm_account`, `sign_in`, `sign_out`, `forgot_password`, `reset_password`, `resend_confirmation`), `outcome` (`success` ou `failure`) e `reason` (conjunto fechado; `none` no sucesso).\n- **Anti-enumeração:** `forgot_password` e `resend_confirmation` respondem igual com ou sem conta, então não revelam se o e-mail existe.\n- **Traces:** cada operação que chega ao caso de uso tem o span `auth.<operação>`; falhas trazem só `auth.error_code`. Recusas antes do caso de uso não têm span `auth.*`.\n- **Sem dados pessoais:** nenhum e-mail, nome, senha, token, IP, `userId` ou `sid` aparece aqui.\n- Os painéis ficam vazios até haver tráfego de auth e o Loki local guarda 24 h."
      }
    }
  ]
}
